  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEN Roundtable, Minority</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PEN Rundabordet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PEN kongress - rundabordssamtal i Moskva. Ryska PEN arrangerar rundabordssamtal p&#xE5; &#xE4;mnet minoritetsspr&#xE5;k, d&#xE4;r minoritetsgruppernas r&#xE4;ttigheter vad g&#xE4;ller spr&#xE5;k, litteratur och kultur diskuteras. Sidas st&#xF6;d till insatsen omfattar SEK 200 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&apos;s contribution will enable Russian PEN to arrange a round table on the subject of minority languages&apos; situation both in Russia and around the world. Subject for discussion will be the rights of ethnic minorities to their language, literature and culture. The Sida- contribution amounts to SEK 200 000.</narrative>
  </description>
